1
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:10,880
When you went to catch Zhang Xiaoshan,

2
00:00:11,510 --> 00:00:13,110
I saw the analysis of
those bloody footprints

3
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:14,820
and came to the same conclusion as you.

4
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:17,070
The evidence and the bodies tell us

5
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:19,390
that if there was a second killer,

6
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:21,510
it was Li Yan.

7
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:32,430
Did you find the killer?

8
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:33,750
After your parents were attacked,

9
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:35,670
did you go to the scene?

10
00:00:41,350 --> 00:00:42,150
I did.

11
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:44,350
At that time,
my parents shoved me into the study

12
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:46,560
to protect me

13
00:00:46,670 --> 00:00:47,960
and told me not to come out.

14
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:51,070
But I was so worried about them.

15
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:53,110
After the noise died down,

16
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:55,350
I wanted to go check on them.

17
00:00:57,470 --> 00:00:58,280
Mom...

18
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:03,560
Call the police...

19
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,430
Call the police...

20
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:06,840
Call the police...

21
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:08,150
I was terrified,

22
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:09,870
so I hid back in the room.

23
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:11,840
Right up until the end,

24
00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:14,350
I kept myself locked inside.

25
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:16,920
I didn't open the door

26
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:18,000
until the police arrived.

27
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:23,000
Alright.

28
00:01:23,870 --> 00:01:24,870
Get some rest.

29
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:26,590
We'll handle the rest.

30
00:01:54,300 --> 00:01:58,300
=Medical Examiner Dr. Qin: Bones of the Past=
=Episode 13=

31
00:01:58,480 --> 00:01:59,680
You suspect Li Yan?

32
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,150
The autopsy results show

33
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:03,480
there were two killers at the scene.

34
00:02:03,510 --> 00:02:04,840
We can confirm

35
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,350
that after Zhang Xiaoshan attacked them,

36
00:02:06,350 --> 00:02:07,870
Li Yan came out of his room
to finish them off

37
00:02:07,900 --> 00:02:09,220
and left behind the bloody footprint.

38
00:02:09,630 --> 00:02:10,590
It also aligns with

39
00:02:10,590 --> 00:02:12,000
why there were two murder weapons.

40
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:13,190
We're investigating

41
00:02:13,190 --> 00:02:15,060
the relationship between
Li Yan and Zhang Xiaoshan.

42
00:02:15,060 --> 00:02:16,180
We suspect it was a hired hit.

43
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,400
I had the Technical Unit recover

44
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:19,000
the chat logs on Li Yan's computer.

45
00:02:19,030 --> 00:02:21,240
What are you planning to do next?

46
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:23,360
We want to conduct
a second search of Li Yan's home.

47
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:24,240
We suspect

48
00:02:24,470 --> 00:02:26,080
that Li Yan hid
the murder weapon in his house.

49
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:34,800
Li Yan.

50
00:02:35,630 --> 00:02:36,750
A disciplined honor student,

51
00:02:37,150 --> 00:02:38,280
an outstanding student,

52
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:39,240
a good kid.

53
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:42,150
I was almost fooled by
all these labels of yours.

54
00:02:42,190 --> 00:02:43,000
Officers,

55
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:44,680
you've got the wrong person?

56
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,680
How could I possibly
kill my own parents?

57
00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:03,060
(Paradise Cinema)

58
00:03:25,190 --> 00:03:27,080
You're smarter than I thought.

59
00:03:28,150 --> 00:03:29,870
My plan was clearly foolproof.

60
00:03:30,710 --> 00:03:32,150
How did you figure it out?

61
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:33,870
Those were your parents.

62
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:37,150
How can you be so calm?

63
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,630
Answer me first,

64
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:41,400
and then I'll answer you.

65
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:43,430
How about that, Officer?

66
00:03:43,750 --> 00:03:45,030
Trying to bargain with me?

67
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:47,000
The hitman you hired

68
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:49,190
already dealt fatal
injuries to your parents.

69
00:03:49,310 --> 00:03:50,680
They weren't going to survive.

70
00:03:50,860 --> 00:03:52,310
When you found out
they weren't completely dead yet,

71
00:03:52,310 --> 00:03:53,910
you stabbed them in the back.

72
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:57,960
It was your cruelty and arrogance

73
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:59,240
that exposed you.

74
00:04:05,750 --> 00:04:07,630
Blame it on them taking too long to die.

75
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:09,750
They ruined my perfect plan.

76
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:12,120
They were your biological parents.

77
00:04:12,590 --> 00:04:14,310
They loved you and raised you.

78
00:04:15,470 --> 00:04:16,920
Don't you have a heart?

79
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:18,390
A heart?

80
00:04:20,070 --> 00:04:22,000
My heart was devoured
by them a long time ago.

81
00:04:27,070 --> 00:04:28,430
Second place...

82
00:04:28,430 --> 00:04:29,070
Second place!

83
00:04:29,070 --> 00:04:30,240
Why second place?

84
00:04:30,360 --> 00:04:32,390
Look at me and tell me why

85
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,510
it's second place!

86
00:04:33,630 --> 00:04:35,920
We spent so much money
sending you to tutoring centers

87
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:37,310
and sacrificed so much for you,

88
00:04:37,310 --> 00:04:39,070
and this is how you repay us?

89
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,360
Second place!

90
00:04:40,410 --> 00:04:42,260
How can you get into Tsinghua
or Peking University with second place?

91
00:04:42,270 --> 00:04:43,070
Tell me.

92
00:04:43,310 --> 00:04:45,360
Look! Look at your own grades.

93
00:04:48,270 --> 00:04:49,070
Dad,

94
00:04:49,950 --> 00:04:50,830
I was wrong.

95
00:04:52,430 --> 00:04:53,430
I'll do better next time.

96
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,720
I was wrong!

97
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:57,600
Second place.

98
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:00,920
Second place.

99
00:05:01,630 --> 00:05:02,560
Second place.

100
00:05:18,500 --> 00:05:25,940
(100-Day Sprint Schedule to
Tsinghua or Peking University)

101
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:39,190
The first year I took the Gaokao,

102
00:05:39,510 --> 00:05:40,630
just because I didn't get into

103
00:05:40,750 --> 00:05:42,040
the top universities they wanted,

104
00:05:42,190 --> 00:05:43,750
I was forced to repeat the year.

105
00:05:44,310 --> 00:05:45,160
I thought last time

106
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:46,750
was already pushing my bottom line,

107
00:05:47,510 --> 00:05:48,720
but reality told me

108
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:50,360
that bottom line keeps
getting dragged lower.

109
00:05:51,140 --> 00:05:53,100
As long as I don't get into
Tsinghua or Peking University,

110
00:05:53,390 --> 00:05:54,720
I don't deserve anything.

111
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,630
I don't deserve happiness,

112
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:57,680
I don't deserve friends,

113
00:05:58,190 --> 00:05:59,870
and I don't deserve to
be treated as a human.

114
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:07,360
I knew you'd be here.

115
00:06:32,510 --> 00:06:33,510
I made the shot.

116
00:06:44,510 --> 00:06:46,680
♪Happy Birthday to you♪

117
00:06:47,070 --> 00:06:49,160
♪Happy Birthday to you♪

118
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:51,630
♪Happy Birthday to you♪

119
00:06:52,310 --> 00:06:54,190
♪Happy Birthday to you♪

120
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:55,680
Happy birthday, Li Yan.

121
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,310
How did you know it's my birthday?

122
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,800
Your date of birth

123
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:01,270
is right after your student ID number.

124
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:03,600
I accidentally remembered it.

125
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:05,560
Make a wish.

126
00:07:09,630 --> 00:07:10,800
My wish is

127
00:07:12,290 --> 00:07:13,460
to get into Tsinghua
or Peking University.

128
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:15,950
Are you sure
that's not your parents' wish?

129
00:07:17,390 --> 00:07:18,190
Li Yan,

130
00:07:18,970 --> 00:07:19,830
look at you two.

131
00:07:19,830 --> 00:07:20,160
Mom.

132
00:07:22,830 --> 00:07:25,190
I saw you sneaking out just now.

133
00:07:25,190 --> 00:07:26,750
You're out here slacking off?

134
00:07:26,750 --> 00:07:28,240
Do you even know what you're doing?

135
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,160
You're tracking me?

136
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:29,950
You're my son,

137
00:07:29,950 --> 00:07:31,310
so what's wrong with me following you?

138
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:32,390
Come home with me now.

139
00:07:32,390 --> 00:07:33,070
Hurry up.

140
00:07:34,310 --> 00:07:35,120
Let's go.

141
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:36,830
Move it.

142
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,040
In their eyes,

143
00:07:39,510 --> 00:07:41,000
my dignity is worthless.

144
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:42,720
That was one thing,

145
00:07:43,060 --> 00:07:45,340
but they had to do it right in front
of the only person I cared about,

146
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:46,360
cruelly,

147
00:07:46,390 --> 00:07:47,360
blow by blow,

148
00:07:47,630 --> 00:07:48,830
crushing it to pieces.

149
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:55,270
Relax a bit.

150
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:57,000
You'll make it in this year.

151
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:58,750
Let's watch a movie first.

152
00:08:00,980 --> 00:08:02,620
(Paradise Cinema:
You Owe Me an Unfinished Song)

153
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:04,720
Thanks.

154
00:08:04,830 --> 00:08:05,630
By the way,

155
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:07,950
I haven't congratulated you
on getting into college.

156
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:11,040
I only got into a third-tier college.

157
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:13,720
Compared to you, it's nothing.

158
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:20,190
I don't want to go to school anymore.

159
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:25,480
Alright,

160
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:26,750
let's watch a movie first.

161
00:08:26,750 --> 00:08:27,920
It's about to start.

162
00:08:31,310 --> 00:08:32,870
I want to get popcorn in a bit.

163
00:08:32,910 --> 00:08:33,720
Sure.

164
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:47,790
What are you doing?

165
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:49,000
Give it to me.

166
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:52,390
Give it to me.

167
00:08:54,870 --> 00:08:56,080
Listen to me, girl.

168
00:08:56,270 --> 00:08:57,390
Have some self-respect.

169
00:08:57,450 --> 00:08:59,220
Don't think just because you
got into some third-tier school,

170
00:08:59,220 --> 00:09:01,120
you can bother my son while he's preparing
for Tsinghua or Peking University.

171
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,270
Listen.

172
00:09:02,270 --> 00:09:03,360
You're not good enough for him.

173
00:09:03,440 --> 00:09:04,390
Do you hear me?

174
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:10,630
Li Yan,

175
00:09:11,630 --> 00:09:13,150
having parents like this

176
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:15,200
is pathetic.

177
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:17,790
What did you say, kid?

178
00:09:17,790 --> 00:09:18,870
Get out of here!

179
00:09:22,030 --> 00:09:23,080
What are you doing?

180
00:09:30,550 --> 00:09:31,750
Let me see what happened.

181
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:50,600
I really wanted to jump back then.

182
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:52,270
Only death

183
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,240
could save me.

184
00:09:56,510 --> 00:09:59,120
Ever since then,
I never grew long hair again.

185
00:09:59,870 --> 00:10:01,480
Is that why you did it?

186
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:08,440
My action

187
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:12,240
was just to save myself.

188
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,150
It's all set.

189
00:10:15,150 --> 00:10:17,120
(Longfan Zhuoli High School
2020 Enrollment Prospectus)

190
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:18,670
You'll go to the cram school next month.

191
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,510
Everything has been arranged for you.

192
00:10:21,020 --> 00:10:22,390
(School Profile)

193
00:10:22,390 --> 00:10:23,240
Fully boarding,

194
00:10:23,870 --> 00:10:24,720
military-style,

195
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,240
complete with barbed wire.

196
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,280
How is this any different from prison?

197
00:10:30,280 --> 00:10:31,670
If you don't get into
Tsinghua or Peking University,

198
00:10:31,670 --> 00:10:34,390
your life won't be
any different from being in prison.

199
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:36,960
A person's potential has
to be driven out of them.

200
00:10:37,750 --> 00:10:38,550
Li Yan,

201
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:40,630
your father and I

202
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:42,150
have spoiled you too much, huh?

203
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:44,910
Son,

204
00:10:46,750 --> 00:10:47,720
if you don't make it,

205
00:10:48,510 --> 00:10:49,510
you just retake the exam.

206
00:10:50,340 --> 00:10:51,270
Study another year and try again.

207
00:10:51,270 --> 00:10:52,630
If you fail again, you retake it again

208
00:10:53,630 --> 00:10:55,240
until you finally get in.

209
00:10:55,550 --> 00:10:57,600
They were the ones
who backed me into a corner first.

210
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:59,200
The boarding school

211
00:10:59,910 --> 00:11:01,790
was no place for human beings.

212
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:06,510
Instead of being
controlled by them there,

213
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:08,360
turning into their test-taking machine,

214
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:10,600
I decided to put an end to it all early.

215
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:12,790
All they wanted was
Tsinghua or Peking University,

216
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:14,320
not me.

217
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:16,670
Then, I would make
their top-university dream,

218
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:18,270
along with them,

219
00:11:19,390 --> 00:11:20,670
disappear together.

220
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:28,320
We recovered the chat logs
from your computer.

221
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,630
You found Zhang Xiaoshan online

222
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:33,600
and hired him to commit murder, right?

223
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:34,630
Yes.

224
00:11:35,670 --> 00:11:36,720
Where did you get the money?

225
00:11:37,870 --> 00:11:39,240
As long as I ranked first,

226
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:41,150
if I asked for money,

227
00:11:41,150 --> 00:11:42,480
they would give it to me.

228
00:11:43,670 --> 00:11:45,200
Besides, if I killed them,

229
00:11:45,630 --> 00:11:46,510
their money

230
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:48,360
would all be mine anyway.

231
00:11:48,790 --> 00:11:50,270
After I paid the deposit,

232
00:11:51,030 --> 00:11:52,200
he made his move.

233
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:54,270
But I thought he
didn't hit them hard enough

234
00:11:54,750 --> 00:11:56,000
and failed to kill them.

235
00:11:56,510 --> 00:11:57,670
They have to die.

236
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:58,750
They have to.

237
00:11:58,910 --> 00:12:00,000
Only if they die

238
00:12:00,270 --> 00:12:01,270
can I live.

239
00:12:01,480 --> 00:12:02,480
Can I live.

240
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:06,320
If they had stayed alive,

241
00:12:07,390 --> 00:12:09,000
the one who dies would be me.

242
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:12,480
It would be me.

243
00:12:58,150 --> 00:12:59,030
Are you satisfied

244
00:13:00,030 --> 00:13:01,150
with me now?

245
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:17,440
Li Yan confessed to everything.

246
00:13:18,670 --> 00:13:19,480
Qin,

247
00:13:20,390 --> 00:13:22,480
why did you sit in on
the interrogation of Li Yan

248
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:23,870
and Zhang Xiaoshan?

249
00:13:25,140 --> 00:13:26,730
The police officer
whom Zhang Daxin killed back then

250
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:28,270
was my father.

251
00:13:31,900 --> 00:13:35,620
(Captain Qin Tian died heroically on Oct 16
while pursuing suspect Zhang Daxin )

252
00:13:44,170 --> 00:13:45,370
Li Yan confessed to everything.

253
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:48,200
He hired you to kill his parents.

254
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:50,960
He confessed just like that?

255
00:13:51,870 --> 00:13:52,750
What a coward.

256
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:54,960
Then we have nothing left to talk about.

257
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:55,910
You didn't know at the time

258
00:13:55,910 --> 00:13:57,550
that he wanted you
to kill his parents, did you?

259
00:13:57,670 --> 00:13:58,600
I knew.

260
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:01,910
Even if I knew, so what?

261
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:06,480
Hello, who are you looking for?

262
00:14:29,510 --> 00:14:30,320
Li,

263
00:14:30,550 --> 00:14:32,750
bring your socks over
so I can wash them together.

264
00:14:34,240 --> 00:14:35,150
Li.

265
00:14:36,550 --> 00:14:37,360
Li.

266
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:38,910
Li.

267
00:14:42,320 --> 00:14:43,120
Who are you?

268
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:45,630
What are you doing?

269
00:14:52,790 --> 00:14:53,600
What are you doing?

270
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:54,550
What are you doing?

271
00:14:57,510 --> 00:14:58,320
What?

272
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:43,720
Is it because you don't have parents

273
00:15:44,150 --> 00:15:45,360
that you make others

274
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:47,270
become just like you?

275
00:15:53,440 --> 00:15:55,960
When I was seven, my mother passed away.

276
00:15:56,240 --> 00:15:58,270
My father killed someone
and was executed.

277
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:00,320
I am the son of a murderer.

278
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:02,550
If you had been
through what I went through,

279
00:16:02,550 --> 00:16:04,600
you wouldn't be saying those

280
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:06,390
stupid words.

281
00:16:17,270 --> 00:16:18,080
Zhang Xiaoshan,

282
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:19,840
if your father hadn't killed anyone,

283
00:16:19,870 --> 00:16:21,200
would you have
turned out like this today?

284
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:23,200
Even if he hadn't killed anyone,
so what?

285
00:16:24,030 --> 00:16:25,720
Life would still be terrible!

286
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:29,600
Can life start over?

287
00:16:46,150 --> 00:16:47,000
Kid,

288
00:16:47,790 --> 00:16:48,600
you made it.

289
00:16:52,570 --> 00:16:57,090
♪The old walkie-talkie I treasure♪

290
00:17:00,160 --> 00:17:04,940
♪The birthday surprise
you gave me that year♪

291
00:17:07,650 --> 00:17:13,030
♪Its buttons worn
and weathered with time♪

292
00:17:13,560 --> 00:17:18,890
♪Still echoing your words,
"Be brave and keep moving on"♪

293
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:28,880
♪The old train rolled over
our reluctance to part♪

294
00:17:29,510 --> 00:17:34,560
♪You waved goodbye
and faded into the night♪

295
00:17:36,600 --> 00:17:44,910
♪I used to think
we'd always have more time♪

296
00:17:44,910 --> 00:17:50,760
♪But that goodbye became the last♪

297
00:17:52,220 --> 00:18:00,340
♪I carry the warmth you left behind♪

298
00:18:01,030 --> 00:18:06,070
♪Making my way
through every door in life♪

299
00:18:07,850 --> 00:18:15,890
♪Whenever a train
whistle sounds at night♪

300
00:18:16,170 --> 00:18:23,440
♪I suddenly long to call out to you♪

301
00:18:23,640 --> 00:18:28,050
♪Can you hear me?♪

302
00:18:28,060 --> 00:18:31,850
♪Can you hear me?♪

303
00:18:31,850 --> 00:18:39,310
♪Let the old receiver
carry the words I never said♪

304
00:18:39,310 --> 00:18:47,050
♪I've taken on
both your duty and your love♪

305
00:18:47,380 --> 00:18:52,990
♪This train has no return, and when I
look back, you're no longer waiting♪

306
00:18:54,870 --> 00:18:58,470
♪After all these years♪

307
00:19:00,980 --> 00:19:08,460
♪How I wish I could
talk to you just one more time♪

308
00:19:09,360 --> 00:19:10,660
♪And tell you♪

309
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:15,150
♪I haven't let you down♪
